rbished-laptops/apple`), Amazon Renewed India (`https://www.amazon.in/`).\n  - Fetching deal aggregators: DesiDime (`https://www.desidime.com`).\n  - Packaging the comprehensive comparison report and sending via `send_message` to `parent`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Apple Silicon RAM Architecture Nuance**:\n  - Apple Silicon MacBook Pros don't strictly have 32GB across all generations:\n    - M1 Pro/Max: 16GB, 32GB, 64GB\n    - M2 Pro/Max: 16GB, 32GB, 64GB, 96GB\n    - M3 Pro/Max: 18GB, 36GB, 48GB, 64GB, 128GB\n    - M4 Pro/Max: 24GB, 48GB, 64GB, 128GB (or base 14\" M4: 16GB, 24GB, 32GB CTO)\n- **Apple Premium Partner Deals (Unicorn Store)**:\n  - Unicorn is running official clearance on sealed, brand-new previous-gen Apple Silicon MacBook Pros:\n    - **14-inch MacBook Pro (M1 Pro, 10-core CPU, 16-core GPU, 16GB/1TB SSD, MKGT3HN/A)**: ₹1,55,935 (35% off MRP of ₹2,39,900) - Brand new sealed, 1-yr Apple warranty.\n    - **14-inch MacBook Pro (M2 Pro)**: ₹1,87,425 (25% off MRP of ₹2,49,900) - Brand new sealed, 1-yr Apple warranty.\n    - **16-inch MacBook Pro (M1 Max, 32GB/64GB)**: ₹2,14,435 (35% off MRP of ₹3,29,900) - Clearance pricing.\n  - Unicorn HSBC Taj Credit Card Partnership (Aug 1 - Sep 30, 2026): Extra **7% instant discount** on MacBooks via HSBC Unicorn Instant EMI portal.\n- **Vijay Sales Bank Offers (September 2026)**:\n  - **HDFC Bank Credit/Debit EMI**: Up to ₹15,000 instant discount (Slabs: ₹1,00,001–₹1,50,000 get ₹6,000; ₹1,50,001–₹2,00,000 get ₹7,500; ₹2,00,001–₹2,50,000 get ₹10,000; ₹2,50,000+ get ₹15,000).\n  - **American Express EMI**: Up to 5% instant discount (Max ₹20,000).\n  - **HSBC Bank Cards**: Up to ₹12,000 instant discount.\n  - **OneCard Credit EMI**: Up to ₹20,000 instant discount.\n  - **IDFC First Bank Credit EMI**: 5% up to ₹10,000.\n  - **ICICI Bank Credit EMI**: 5% up to ₹7,500.\n  - **Exchange bonus**: Vijay Sales and Croma offer ₹5,000 to ₹10,000 additional exchange bonus above Cashify/Servify base trade-in evaluation for old laptops.\n- **Apple Official Store vs. Resellers**:\n  - Apple Store Online: Almost zero direct cash discounts on standard or CTO 32GB/36GB/48GB models except ₹10,000 HDFC/American Express instant cashback + Education Store discount (8-10% off + free AirPods during Back to University promotions).\n  - APRs (Unicorn, Aptronix, Imagine, Vijay Sales, Croma): 5%–10% baseline store discounts + up to ₹15,000–₹20,000 bank card instant discounts + upfront clearance discounts (up to 25%–35% on sealed M1/M2/M3 stock).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context & Intermediate State\n- Need to check Sahivalue / Cashify / CeX for open-box/pre-owned/refurbished 32GB/36GB M-series models.\n- Need to check DesiDime / PriceBefore for aggregator coupon codes or historical lowest price tracker links.\n- All collected data will be synthesized into a structured markdown report.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. Fetch Sahivalue (`https://www.sahivalue.com/category/macbook-pro` or search) and Cashify Refurbished MacBooks (`https://www.cashify.in/buy-refurbished-laptops/apple`) to extract specific open-box / refurbished pricing for 32GB/36GB models.\n2. Fetch DesiDime / aggregator deals page for MacBooks.\n3. Synthesize the complete 7-section report matching all user questions with exact INR pricing, retailer URLs, card offers, exchange mechanics, open-box sources, APR comparisons, and price comparison table.\n4. **MANDATORY**: Send the final report via `send_message` to `Recipient: \"b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002\"`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Subagent MUST use `send_message` to communicate results to `parent` (`b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002`). Any text output directly to the window is not seen by the parent caller.\n- Include source URLs and actual INR prices where available.\n- Focus strictly on Apple Silicon (M-series: M1/M2/M3/M4/M5), strictly avoiding Intel Macs.\n</summary>"}
